summary:
  A station waiting for its next knock is never recognised as waiting, and
  the footer goes back to "Choose station and enjoy…" under its name.

history:
  Seen on the bench on 2026-09-23: a station at a dead address, the retry
  ladder armed, and for the 30 s before knock #1 the footer read like a
  widget with nothing to do.

target:
  package/contents/ui/RetryLogic.js

find:
      return wantsPlaying === true && (attempts | 0) > 0;

replace:
      return false;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_retrylogic.qml::test_a_station_waiting_for_its_next_knock_is_between_knocks.
  Line-neutral.
